      <p>High-density GPU compute in a mobile, self-powered form factor. MEAICON delivers 240 kW of total IT capacity within a single 40ft container, engineered for field operations where rapid deployment and operational autonomy are non-negotiable.</p>
      <p>Designed for extreme-environment deployments across the MEA region, the platform provides single-source accountability — one contract, one warranty, one SLA — eliminating multi-vendor integration risk.</p>
