        </div>
        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>MEAICON's mobile data centre places high-density GPU compute in a road-mobile, self-powered container form factor. With 240 kW total IT capacity across 10 racks at 24 kW per rack density, the platform is designed to operate in environments where conventional data centre infrastructure cannot reach.</p>
          <p>The platform is certified for +50°C ambient operation and engineered for 18+ days of continuous full-load operation without grid power or fuel resupply. A tractor-coupled architecture means compute and data roll within minutes of arrival, enabling rapid deployment to operational sites across the MEA region.</p>
